1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,760
Still exhausted and stuck at the same weight even though you take your thyroid pill every morning?

2
00:00:05,128 --> 00:00:07,444
It might not be your dose that's the problem.

3
00:00:07,812 --> 00:00:14,733
Coffee can cut how much levothyroxine your body actually absorbs by up to 30% if you drink it too soon.

4
00:00:15,101 --> 00:00:19,041
Wait 30 to 60 minutes after your pill before that first sip.

5
00:00:19,409 --> 00:00:24,874
Soy binds to the medication in your gut and blocks a big chunk of it from reaching your bloodstream.

6
00:00:25,242 --> 00:00:29,112
Keep soy milk or tofu at least 4 hours from your dose.

7
00:00:29,480 --> 00:00:33,491
Walnuts work the same way - give it that same 4-hour gap.

8
00:00:33,859 --> 00:00:37,037
It's not about giving these up for good, just timing.

9
00:00:37,405 --> 00:00:42,985
Take your pill on an empty stomach and give it room to work before anything else touches your system.
